DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_B1C8_5DC8';
<p>b1c8_5dc8</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #993e11;">Gene F</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #993e11;"><i>fuzzy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #993e11;">Gene F</span> is covered in a dense layer of hairs, giving it a soft appearance.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene K</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene W</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, kidney, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,419</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">53,203</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">27,856</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">7,440</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">7,566</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">28,172</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">52,823</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,521</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">180,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>F</b> and <b>W</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>F</b> and <b>W</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_B1C8_5DC8
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(1,419 + 1,521 + 27,856 + 28,172)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>58,968</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.3276 = <strong>32.76 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(1,419 + 1,521 + 7,440 + 52,823)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>63,203</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.3511 = <strong>35.11 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(1,419 + 1,521 + 7,440 + 7,566)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>17,946</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.0997 = <strong>9.97 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(1,419 + 1,521 + 7,566 + 28,172)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>38,678</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.2149 = <strong>21.49 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(1,521 + 7,566 + 28,172 + 53,203)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>90,462</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.5026 = <strong>50.26 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(52,823 + 53,203)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>106,026</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.5890 = <strong>58.90 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(1,419 + 1,521 + 27,856 + 28,172)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>58,968</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.3276 = <strong>32.76 cM</strong>
LITERAL_B1C8_5DC8_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
